1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,133
At midnight, the air gets thin. Dust
from the carpet. Perfume in the air.
Your lungs close like a fist.

2
00:00:06,633 --> 00:00:12,567
Look at me. Don't fight it. Out for
four. In for two. Your grandfather
taught that to your father.

3
00:00:13,100 --> 00:00:18,200
Rule thirteen. When your lungs close,
slow down. Panic is the second attack.

4
00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:23,533
By dawn, you can speak again. She
holds your hand, just like she did
when you were six.
